{"title":"Reminder! Oakridge Trails Alliance Fundraiser: This Custom Black Cat Bicycles is Up For Grabs","link":"https://theradavist.com/oakridge-trails-alliance-fundraiser","date":1788880692000,"content":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/f0d21714d5f7cc0e04982292fe568497535fb7c2290096267ce25d1b635fc58d.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/c7d46cd194704b64de04a9b3e56adf1c33df5eb2f7e707ba38b5a6bf260f1eda.jpg 640w, /media/f0d21714d5f7cc0e04982292fe568497535fb7c2290096267ce25d1b635fc58d.jpg 1800w, /media/897083a134e93f38feec6c41a25f7407ae868733f698c888d79b79e50856c183.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://theradavist.com/the-cascade-cougar-a-black-cat-bicycles-fundraiser-for-oakridge-trails-alliance\" target=\"_blank\">The Cascade Cougar</a> is a hand-built drop bar 29er made by <a href=\"https://www.blackcatbicycles.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Black Cat Bicycles</a> in California. It’s laced with a balleur build kit from various US manufacturers, and all proceeds go to the <a href=\"https://www.oakridgetrailsalliance.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Oakridge Trails Alliance</a>…</em><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/13c07c33e7762549773dc381ec37383a00f251fbc6c8d84f58a2ba3369954be3.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/7516529dff8fe44285b52a1e5515b28cf8763b8edac8743d6da6c83fce59a938.jpg 800w, /media/a67d5dc1f9f0f1e676877e8869aacae6a444274c3dff90795d9d1f8c9f4e3106.jpg 1600w, /media/13c07c33e7762549773dc381ec37383a00f251fbc6c8d84f58a2ba3369954be3.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/cc9b9470c55fd9967118534eaa56b96383c204aeb23ea58a155b6313b9f4d108.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/75a326b9e3eba0008e80ffd3659614bdceb89cb2311c3232152073998fbd5ffc.jpg 800w, /media/8e1b75a8fc2657816c3e73c4a80c4b1c846fd527a8fa9f40b288efed040a89ed.jpg 1600w, /media/cc9b9470c55fd9967118534eaa56b96383c204aeb23ea58a155b6313b9f4d108.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>The bike’s sizing comes in around a size large and is laced with components from <a href=\"https://astralcycling.com/\">Astral Cycling</a>, <a href=\"https://www.whiteind.com/\">White Industries</a>, <a href=\"https://www.btchnbikes.com/\">BTCHN’ Bikes</a>, <a href=\"https://www.brooksengland.com/\">Brooks England</a>, <a href=\"https://www.wolftoothcomponents.com/\">Wolf Tooth</a>, <a href=\"https://madmonkeydesigns.com/\">Mad Monkey</a>, <a href=\"https://madronecycles.com/\">Madrone</a>, <a href=\"https://www.teravail.com/\">Teravail</a>, and <a href=\"https://kingcage.com/\">King Cage</a> to bring this raffle build to the next level.</p>\n<p>See more about the bike here: <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/the-cascade-cougar-a-black-cat-bicycles-fundraiser-for-oakridge-trails-alliance\" target=\"_blank\">The Cascade Cougar: A Black Cat Bicycles Fundraiser for Oakridge Trails Alliance</a></p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://givebutter.com/made-bike-show-2026-bfcmuk\" target=\"_blank\">ENTER TO WIN THIS VERY BIKE AT GIVEBUTTER!</a></h3>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/oakridge-trails-alliance-fundraiser\">Reminder! Oakridge Trails Alliance Fundraiser: This Custom Black Cat Bicycles is Up For Grabs</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"John Watson","comments":"https://theradavist.com/oakridge-trails-alliance-fundraiser#respond","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"42e0aeb0243807127b3b2789d1899f83f0bfb19f7302ee31118dadabc2de8179","category":"Cycling"}